# 统一按 LF 存进仓库，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间反复出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制夹具：不要让 git 做换行转换或 diff
*.pdf   binary
*.doc   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.ps1   text eol=crlf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# 语言统计：把开发日志排除在"文档占比"之外
docs/DEVELOPMENT-LOG.md linguist-documentation
